            },
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>The game on this page aims to reinforce two axioms of addition: the addition identity (<b>a + 0 = a</b>) and the commutative axiom (<b>a + b = b + a</b>). Before starting, we suggest studying the following texts:</p><p><ul><li><b>Walking Among the Numbers</b>: we learn that adding zero to any number leaves the number unchanged (<htcite0>).</li> <li><b>The Order of Addition</b>: we learn that the order of addition does not change the result (<htcite1>).</li></ul></p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "6e3666ca-88e4-4b5e-a717-c42056476a77",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Walking Among the Numbers",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "8fe2026a-08b0-4297-b480-cb76d11dfa0f",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "The Order of Addition",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
