      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### How to play\n\nThe game has three levels. In each level, an equation with empty spaces is shown, and you must complete it using the arrows under each empty space. When the two sides of the equation become equal, the exercise is complete.\n\n- **Level 1**: reinforces the addition identity. The left side shows <b>a + 0</b>. Use the arrows to place the value <b>a</b> on the right side.\n- **Level 2**: reinforces the commutative axiom. The left side shows <b>a + b</b>. One value on the right side is already placed. Use the arrows to complete the missing value.\n- **Level 3**: reinforces the commutative axiom again. The left side shows <b>a + b</b>. Use the arrows to place both values on the right side.\n\nThese axioms are introduced in the previous texts (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "7a9c733b-ca13-40f5-8849-19012540b028",
                     "text": "Ernst, Dana.",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2014",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><center><div class=\"compGame\"><p id=\"axLevelTitle\" class=\"compLevel\"></p><p id=\"axInstr\" class=\"compInstr\"></p><div id=\"axTable\"></div><div class=\"compFeedback\"><p id=\"axMsgCorrect\" class=\"compMsg compMsgCorrect\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> Correct!</p><p id=\"axMsgLevelComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Level complete!</p><p id=\"axMsgGameComplete\" class=\"compMsg compMsgFinish\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\"></i> Game complete! Congratulations!</p></div><p id=\"axProgress\" class=\"compProgress\"></p><p id=\"axScoreText\" class=\"compScore\"></p><p><button type=\"button\" id=\"axNext\" class=\"compNext\" style=\"display: none;\"></button> <button type=\"button\" id=\"axRestart\" class=\"compNext\"></button></p><div style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"axWordLevel\">Level</span><span id=\"axWordExercise\">Exercise</span><span id=\"axWordOf\">of</span><span id=\"axWordScore\">Score</span><span id=\"axWordEquation\">Equation</span><span id=\"axWordArrows\">Arrows</span><span id=\"axWordNextLevel\">Next level</span><span id=\"axWordRestart\">Restart</span><span id=\"axWordPlayAgain\">Play again</span><span id=\"axWordLevel1\">a + 0 = a</span><span id=\"axWordLevel2\">a + b = b + a (Part 1)</span><span id=\"axWordLevel3\">a + b = b + a (Part 2)</span><span id=\"axWordInstr1\">Use the arrows to set the value on the right so that both sides of the equation are equal.</span><span id=\"axWordInstr2\">Use the arrows to complete the missing value on the right so that both sides of the equation are equal.</span><span id=\"axWordInstr3\">Use the arrows to fill in both values on the right so that both sides of the equation are equal.</span></div></div></center></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The addition identity is presented in <i>Walking Among the Numbers</i> (<htcite0>), and the commutative axiom in <i>The Order of Addition</i> (<htcite1>).</p>",
